---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="页面不存在 · 任孟锴">
  <section class="wrap grid items-center gap-10 py-16 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr] md:py-24">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 420 160" class="w-full max-w-[460px]" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M10 80 L170 80" stroke="var(--line-factory)" stroke-width="14" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
      <circle cx="170" cy="80" r="14" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="5"></circle>
      <path class="gap" d="M250 80 L410 80" stroke="var(--line-uniform)" stroke-width="14" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
      <circle class="gap" cx="250" cy="80" r="14" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="5"></circle>
      <text x="210" y="150" text-anchor="middle" class="code">404</text>
    </svg>
    <div>
      <h1 class="h1">这一站不存在</h1>
      <p class="lead mt-4 max-w-[26em]">链接可能写错了，或者页面已经搬走。从下面这几站重新出发：</p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/" class="pill">回首页</a>
        <a href="/blog" class="pill pill-ghost">博客</a>
        <a href="/projects" class="pill pill-ghost">工作</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .code {
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 850;
    font-stretch: 120%;
    fill: var(--ink-3);
  }

  :global(html.js) .gap {
    animation: drift 900ms var(--ease-pop) 200ms both;
  }

  @keyframes drift {
    from {
      transform: translateX(-80px);
    }
    to {
      transform: translateX(0);
    }
  }
</style>
